(7757943, 1284098, 61971, '<td valign="top">Adorable peek a boo moment! I have two black kittens myself and they are a handful. :) Love the composition and the pink against the grey it really makes the kitten pop.</td>', 'Adorable peek a boo moment! I have two black kittens myself and they are a handful. :) Love the composition and the pink against the grey it really makes the kitten pop.', '2023-09-23 18:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7757944, 1284087, 61971, '<td valign="top">Awesome POV :) love the layers going into the background. The colors are giving me the fall warmies. Nice use of the vignette as well.</td>', 'Awesome POV :) love the layers going into the background. The colors are giving me the fall warmies. Nice use of the vignette as well.', '2023-09-23 18:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7757945, 1284071, 61971, '<td valign="top">Poor guy, I like the composition and textures here. A smidge more saturation or contrast would have made it a bit better for me.</td>', 'Poor guy, I like the composition and textures here. A smidge more saturation or contrast would have made it a bit better for me.', '2023-09-23 18:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7757946, 1283978, 61971, '<td valign="top">I like the texture, as a whole it seems so simple but at the same time it''s so busy. Pretty neat effect.</td>', 'I like the texture, as a whole it seems so simple but at the same time it''s so busy. Pretty neat effect.', '2023-09-23 18:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7757947, 1284078, 61971, '<td valign="top">Wish I had that energy lol. I like the composition. The really bright red guy in the background is drawing my eye a bit though.</td>', 'Wish I had that energy lol. I like the composition. The really bright red guy in the background is drawing my eye a bit though.', '2023-09-23 18:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7757948, 1284092, 61971, '<td valign="top">I love the concept and the color, but it didn''t really hit for me. I don''t know if it is because she looks awkward in her pose or if it is all the lines in the steps and fencing.</td>', 'I love the concept and the color, but it didn''t really hit for me. I don''t know if it is because she looks awkward in her pose or if it is all the lines in the steps and fencing.', '2023-09-23 18:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7757949, 1284074, 61971, '<td valign="top">Love this candid and the black and white. Would have been better for me with a bit of a different crop to make the line of walkers draw you through the picture.</td>', 'Love this candid and the black and white. Would have been better for me with a bit of a different crop to make the line of walkers draw you through the picture.', '2023-09-23 18:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
